<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1>We buy software businesses that don't fit the usual exit paths.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Kura buys small, vertical software companies from founders who want a
        thoughtful transition and a long-term home for their team, customers,
        and product.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
      </p>
      <p class="origin small muted">
        Kura (蔵), pronounced "koo-rah," is a Japanese storehouse built to
        protect valuable possessions across generations. We thought it was
        fitting.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero .lead {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero .origin {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
</style>
